# === Fine-Tuning Checklist ===
# 1. Start with defaults (~1 day observation min)
# 2. If alert win_rate < 45% after 5+ trades: reduce SIZE_WEIGHT by 0.15 or lower TIME_EXIT_ROI_THRESHOLD
# 3. If alert always exits early via Time Exit: increase TIME_EXIT_MIN by 5-10 min steps
# 4. If Partial TP never triggers: lower PARTIAL_TP_R_MULTIPLE from 2.0 -> 1.5 -> 1.0
# 5. If max drawdown > 5%: increase ATR_K by 0.2 (wider initial SL) or lower SIZE_WEIGHT
# 6. Rebalance weights every 8-12 hours based on /learning-summary win_rate/avg_roi
